          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacwo kosa dhako moro m'oluw gi jwogi pa jom'otho kosa obedi gi ndijo ma ŋeyo gim'opanere iripo neko adieri; wocadhi jo gi telin, aka remo pajo ladoŋ i wi jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.27",
